  "description": "Single storey rear extension (demolition of rear extension)",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The proposed single storey rear infill and rear extension by reason of its depth, siting and height would result in an overly prominent and overbearing development and would give rise to a loss of outlook and a sense of enclosure, to the detriment of the visual and residential amenities of the occupiers of No. 94 Cecil Road. The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3.D(7) of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021 and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
